      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "Welcome to the heavy end of the arsenal. HV is where GregGuns grows teeth: belt-fed machine guns, anti-materiel rifles, rocket and grenade launchers, a flamethrower and two power tools that double as weapons. The gate material is stainless steel, so bring a few plates.\n\nEvery HV gun is built in an HV Assembler (480 EU/t) from stainless steel plates and screws, often with small springs, plus parts you already know from earlier tiers. The recipes get long, so press R over any gun in NEI and work backwards. The quests below start with shared components, then the guns that use them.\n\nAmmo moves up a tier as well. High caliber rounds, rockets and the fuel tank are HV work, made in the Ammo Press and the Assembler.\n\n[note]Quests only check that you are carrying the item. Nothing is ever taken from you, so keep your plates.[/note]",
